+             * has 256 voices; any other value but the 0xFFFF terminator
+             * indexes past every per-voice table here (the debug state,
+             * the voice locks, the resampler state) -- voice_process's
+             * assert is compiled out in a release build. Tony Hawk's
+             * Underground reached one while reloading sound for its main
+             * menu, and the write through g_dbg.vp.v[v] segfaulted the VP
+             * thread. Treat it as the end of the list for this frame. */
+            if (v >= MCPX_HW_MAX_VOICES) {
